1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://aalborgstift.dk/stiftet/kirker?--fit_diocesedata-churchdb%5B%40package%5D=fit.diocesedata&--fit_diocesedata-churchdb%5B%40controller%5D=gallery&--fit_diocesedata-churchdb%5B%40action%5D=show&--fit_dioceseda
