1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Eiler Jacobsen Høeg Banner''' was born in 1604. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-88815099 Jacob Justesen Høeg Banner, til Trudsholm] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34621759387 Marine Eilersdatter Bryske]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eiler married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34621759240 Else Tagesdatter Krabbe]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-73633348 Tage Høeg Banner]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34630724972 Ann Ei
2 CONC lersdatter Høeg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34652226636 Anne Eilersdatter Høeg (Banner)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34652226650 Marie Eilersdatter Høeg (Banner), til Aggersborg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34652226681 T
2 CONC age Eilersen Høeg (Banner)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1660 in Odense. 
2 CONT ----
