1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Anne Jørgensdatter (c. 1563 – after 1651)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestress of the prominent [http://www.tuxen.info/coldevin/historie.htm '''Coldevin family'''] in Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Parentage''': Daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Jørgen-Stenshede/6000000003421924369?through=6000000007255394401 '''Jørgen Lauridsen (Vognsen af Stenshede)'''], Councilman, Burgomaster, and Lawman (Lagmann) in Tønsberg
2 CONC . Her lineage connects the Danish noble house of '''Vognsen af Stenshede''' to the administrative elite of 17th-century Norway.
2 CONT * '''Marriages and Issue''':
2 CONT 1. '''Cort Coldevey (Coldevin'''): A bailiff (fogd) from Denmark and later city bailiff (byfogd) in Tønsberg (1627). This marriage established the Coldevin family in Norway. Their children included:
2 CONT * '''Jørgen Cortsen Coldevin''': Councilman and Burgomaster of Tønsberg (1651–1656). Married to Johanne Isaksdatter Falck.
2 CONT * '''Oluf Cortsen Coldevin''': Burgomaster of Tønsberg (1650). Married to Kirsten Olufsdatter Stranger.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Alhed-Coldevey/6000000022163540838?through=6000000003421923296 '''Alhed Cortsdatter'''] (c. 1611–1690): Married to '''Simen N. N.'''
2 CONT 2. '''Jørgen Schröder''': The succeeding Lawman (Lagmann) of Tønsberg. Anne is recorded as his widow in 1651.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # '''Torkel Fagerli''': "Trelasthandler Christen Simensen i Sandefjord - og litt om Coldevin, Giedde, Mørch, Lem", Gjallarhorn nr. 38, juni 2006, side 375-380.
2 CONT # '''Lokalhistoriewiki.no''': [https://lokalhistoriewiki.no/wiki/Jørgen_Lauritsen_(d._1600) Jørgen Lauritsen (d. 1600)].
2 CONT # '''Tuxen.info''': [http://www.tuxen.info/coldevin/historie.htm Coldevin Slægtstavle].
2 CONT # '''Sveinaage.com''': [https://www.sveinaage.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Notteroy-garder-sok.pdf Nøtterøy Gårds- og slektshistorie].
2 CONT ——————
2 CONT
2 CONT "...annen datter, Anna Jørgensdatter var gift med fogd Cort Coldevey og dermed stammor til slekta Coldevin" 
2 CONT *[https://lokalhistoriewiki.no/wiki/Jørgen_Lauritsen_(d._1600) Link]
2 CONT
2 CONT Cort Coldevey g. Anne Jørgensdatter, (datter af rådmand, borgmester og lagmand i Tønsberg Jørgen Lauritsen). 
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.tuxen.info/coldevin/coldevin_slaegtstavle.htm Link 1]
2 CONT
2 CONT *[https://www.sveinaage.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Notteroy-garder-sok.pdf Link 2]
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT Anne også gift med Jørgen Skrøder, etter hvem hun var enke i 1651
