1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Strange Ebbesen Bild, til Nordentoft''' was born in Thisted, Denmark. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-9600343 Ebbe Strangesen Bild] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-9601028 Bege Bugge]. He was a Væbner. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Strange married [https://www.geni.com/profile-9601511 Mette Olufsdatter Glob] circa 1346 in Thisted, Denmark. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-33282784 Peder Strangesen]; [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/profile-33281844 Ebbe Bild, til Rolstrup]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-13610546 Mette Strangesdatter Bild]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-6904996 Niels Strangesen Bild]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31843881 Otte Strangesen B
2 CONC ild, til Tange]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-120997689 N.N. Strangesdatter Bild]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34682795850 Christine Strangesen (Bild)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died after circa 1360 in Nordentoft, Spøttrup, Midtjylland, Danmark. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT And now for something complety different
2 CONT
2 CONT The blazon of the arms is:  Per fess Argent and Sable. Crest: Two horns per fess Argent and Sable counterchanged.
2 CONT
2 CONT And the shield is twisted. Couché in English heraldry.
