2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 1491-07-17''' på sistnämnda ställe med riksrådet och riddaren samt lagmannen i Östergötland [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Grip#TAB_2 '''Nils Bosson''' (Grip)], född, omkr. 1460, död 1522-02-14 i Täppe by i [https:/
2 CONC /sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/V%C3%A4stra_Ving%C3%A5kers_socken Vingåkers socken], Södermanlands län, ihjälslagen av sina landbönder.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Arvid Birgersson Trolle and Beata Ivarsdatter Thott 
2 CONT * Born:  1476-02-04 on Ed, Voxtorp, Värnamo, Sweden 
2 CONT * Died: 1532-11-01 Fållnäs, Sorunda, Sweden 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: Axel Eriksen Urup til Ugerup, who was Lensmand or County Sheriff of Sölvesborg etc. until his death. After his death she was in charge of the two fiefs in Skåne, which was  incorporated in Sweden in 1658 
2 CONT * Married Nils Bosson (son of Bo Nilsson Tab. 1.). Murder in Täppa, Västra Vingåkers socket 1522. Knight. Married 1491 at Fållnäs in the Sorunda parish with Anna Arvidsdotter, daughter of the Knight and Arctic Trolle Council 36 an
2 CONC d Beata Ivarsdotter (Tott).
2 CONT
2 CONT 1540-45 County Sheriff Anne Arvidsdatter Trolle of Åsum and Elleholm Len, Denmark (Now Sweden) 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Axel Eriksen Urup til Ugerup==
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Nils Bosson (Grip) (~1460 - 1522)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Anna, dead young
2 CONT * Karin, dead young
2 CONT * Yrian, dead young
2 CONT * Beata Nilsdotter, died in 1547 at Björvik in Östra Ryds parish. Married 1514 with the knight and the council Holger Karlsson (Gera).
2 CONT * Kerstin Nilsdotter, died in 1538. Married 1527 with the Knight and the Riksrådet Jöran Eriksson Gyllenstierna
2 CONT * Birger Nilsson, Knight, National Council, Death 1565. see Tab. 3.
2 CONT * Ingeborg Nilsdotter, probably dead in 1533. Married to Åke Johansson (Night and Day No 13)
2 CONT * Peder Nilsson, born 1507, died in 1533. Married 1532 with Görvel Fadersdotter, daughter of Father Nilsson (Sparre of Hjulsta and Ängsö) and Botil Knutsdotter (Tre Rosor).
2 CONT * Birgitta Nilsdotter, died in 1549. Married 1536 with the castle act at Stockholm Castle Björn Pedersson (Boat)
2 CONT * Marina Nilsdotter, Hovmästarinna. Married to the knight and the council Karl Eriksson (Gyllenstierna).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
