1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Alhed Cortsdatter (c. 1611 – 1690)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT A member of the prominent [http://www.tuxen.info/coldevin/historie.htm Coldevin family] of Tønsberg, whose life and descendants are well-documented in regional church books and genealogical studies.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Parentage''': Daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Cort-Coldevey/6000000003421923289?through=6000000003421923296 '''Cort Coldevey (Coldevin)'''], city bailiff (byfogd) in Tønsberg, and [https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Co
2 CONC ldevey-Schrøder/6000000003421923296?through=6000000003421923289 '''Anne Jørgensdatter'''] (daughter of Lawman Jørgen Lauritsen).
2 CONT * '''Birth and Death''': Born around '''1611'''. She was buried on '''July 10, 1690''', from Our Lady's Church (''Vår Frues kirke'') in Tønsberg. According to the parish register of St. Laurentius, she was '''79 5/12 years old''' 
2 CONC at the time of her death.
2 CONT * '''Marriage and Issue''': Married to '''Simen N. N.''' Their children included:
2 CONT # '''Christen Simensen''' (d. c. 1685): A timber merchant (''trelasthandler'') in Sandefjord. Married with at least 7 children.
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Johanne-Mørch/6000000015472124015?through=6000000022163540838 '''Johanne Simensdatter'''] (c. 1639–1716): Married to [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Aleksandersson-Allexsen-Mørch/600000001547046479
2 CONC 6?through=6000000015472124015 '''Knut Alexandersen Mørch''']. Buried in Sandefjord at the age of 77.
2 CONT # '''Peder Simensen''' (d. 1690): A shipmaster (skipper) in Sandefjord. Married to '''Margrethe Michelsdatter (Due)'''. His probate (skifte) is dated October 4, 1690.
2 CONT # '''Aarse Simensdatter''' (d. 1693): Married to '''Lauritz Andersen Haug''' in Sandefjord. Her probate is dated February 14, 1693.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # '''Torkel Fagerli''': "Trelasthandler Christen Simensen i Sandefjord - og litt om Coldevin, Giedde, Mørch, Lem", Gjallarhorn nr. 38, juni 2006, side 375-380.
2 CONT # '''Tuxen.info''': [http://www.tuxen.info/coldevin/historie.htm Coldevin Slægtstavle].
2 CONT # '''Sveinaage.com''': [https://www.sveinaage.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Notteroy-garder-sok.pdf Nøtterøy Gårds- og slektshistorie].
2 CONT # '''Church Records''': Parish register for St. Laurenti sogn, Tønsberg (1690).
2 CONT ——————
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: 
2 CONT *http://www.tuxen.info/coldevin/coldevin_slaegtstavle.htm
2 CONT *Torkel Fagerli: "Trelasthandler Christen Simensen i Sandefjord - og litt om Coldevin, Giedde, Mørch, Lem", Gjallarhorn nr. 38, juni 2006, side 375-380.
2 CONT *https://www.sveinaage.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Notteroy-garder-sok.pdf
