1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Kirsten Lauridsdatter Vognsen af Stenshede (c. 1575/80 – after 1633)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT A Danish noblewoman whose inheritance of the family estate and marriage to the Munk (Vinranke) family are key markers in the Vognsen af Stenshede lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT ⚠️'''Parentage and Chronological Note (OBS!)''':
2 CONT Daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Lars-Jorgensen-Vognsen-Stenshede-of-Hassinggaard/6000000010531322554 '''Laurids Jørgensen'''] (Vognsen) til Strøm (c. 1560–1627).
2 CONT * '''Crucial Identification''': Based on chronological evidence, Kirsten '''cannot''' be the daughter of her father’s later wife, [https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Stråle-Dyre/6000000010531276618?through=6000000010531322554 '''Ann
2 CONC a Pedersdatter Maaneskjold''']. Kirsten’s husband died in 1626, and their children were born in the late 1500s/early 1600s, long before Laurids' marriage to Anna. Kirsten is the daughter of Laurids Jørgensen from a previous (unide
2 CONC ntified) marriage or union.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Estate and Standing''':
2 CONT According to Danmarks Adels Aarbog '''(1936:2, [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf p. 106])''', Kirsten was the lady of '''Hassinggaard''' in Kjær Herred as of 1633 ("Kirsten til Hassinggaard, Kjær H."). This confirms her lega
2 CONC l right to the inheritance of her great-uncle, '''Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt''', and her father, Laurids.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage and Issue''':
2 CONT Married to '''Niels Munk (Vinranke)''' (b. 1552 – '''d. May 29, 1626, in Moss, Norway''').
2 CONT The couple’s children, as recorded in the lineage, were:
2 CONT * '''Niels Vognsen Munk (Vinranke)''': (d. before 1644). He carried his mother's lineage name ("Vognsen") as a middle name, a common practice to preserve noble identity.
2 CONT * '''Anne Nielsdatter Munk (Vinranke)''': (d. after 1653).
2 CONT * '''Else Nielsdatter Munk (Vinranke)''': (d. after 1656).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # '''Danmarks Adels Aarbog (DAÅ)''': 1936:II, [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf p. 106] (Fjerde Slægtled).
2 CONT # '''Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift''': 1989:2 (Dion S. E. Maaneskjold), [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/900550.pdf pp. 126, 128].
2 CONT # '''Kr. Værnfelt i JySaml. 5. Rk. III'''. 1937–38, [https://halsarkiv.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Det-gamle-Vester-Hassing.pdf p. 178].
2 CONT # '''Trap Danmark: 5th Edition''', Vol. VI, 2 (Ålborg Amt), regarding the history of [https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 Vester Hassing Hovgård].
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kirsten Lauridsdatter Vognsen af Stenshede'''
2 CONT
2 CONT OBS! Kan av kronologiska skäl omöjligtvis vara dotter till Anna Pedersdotter Måneskiöld. Fadern Laurids gifte sig inte med Anna förrän i början av 1600-talet och Kirsten får egna barn redan i slutet av 1500-talet.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Familie'''	
2 CONT * Niels Nielsen Munk (Vinranke),   f. 1552, Hungstrup, Tvede (Nørhald H., Randers) ,   d. 29 maj 1626, Moss, Østfold, Norge  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Børn''' 	
2 CONT * +	1. Niels Vognsen Munk (Vinranke),       d. før 1644
2 CONT * 	2. Anne Nielsdatter Munk (Vinranke),   d. eft. 1653
2 CONT * +	3. Else Nielsdatter Munk (Vinranke),    d. eft. 1656
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Källa:'''  
2 CONT * Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1936:II:106.
