2 CONT Positions and titles
2 CONT
2 CONT * In November 1660 he was appointed imperial commander, president of War College and member of State College.
2 CONT * He got his nobel letters patents for the county of Riberhus and Møgeltønder in January 1661 and was also rigid cadre of Ribe Diocese. These offices he retained for 1674, where he was succeeded by his son Otto Diderik Schack.
2 CONT * From 1661-63, he was having inspection of Lundenæs County.
2 CONT * In October 1663 he became [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_the_Elephant/ Knight, Order of the Elephant].
2 CONT * In 1670 a member of Gehejmekonseil (State Council). 
2 CONT * Appointed to count on 25 May 1671.
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_the_Dannebrog/ Knight, Order of the Dannebrog] in October 1671.
