1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Ottesdatter Bild[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hun henregnes ellers overalt til Slægten Skinckel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Far 	Otte Strangesen Bild,   d. eft. 1397 (Troligare, Otte van Skinkel,)  Mor N.N. Steensen el. Straale
2 CONT
2 CONT Familie 	Niels Jensen Rosenkrantz,   f. ca. 1352,   d. 1424 
2 CONT
2 CONT Børn 	
2 CONT
2 CONT >	1. Timme Nielsen Rosenkrantz,   d. før 1457
2 CONT
2 CONT >	2. Otte Nielsen Rosenkrantz,   f. ca. 1395, Tange ,   d. før okt. 1477
2 CONT
2 CONT Billeder	
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Coat of arms - Bild
2 CONT
2 CONT et tværdelt skjold delt af sølv og sort, to vesselhorn på hjelmen delt af sølv og sort. Våbnet findes i flere varianter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notater 	
2 CONT
2 CONT henregnes for det meste til slægten Skinkel, men findes ikke i DAA 1916.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilder 	
2 CONT
2 CONT [S2] Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1888:65.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I6297&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT KJM 29.9. 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: this profile is commonly mistaken for ANNE OTTESDATTER SKINKEL - Please do not merge the two profiles.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nermo.org/  suggests Anne Ottesdatter Skinkel is Niels Jensen Rosenkrantz' wife and mother of 4 of his childeren:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Jens Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Skarsow Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. +Timme Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. +Otte Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT Holbek refers to Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1888:65. none of the current managers in this part of the tree has been able to verify this reference, howev
2 CONC er to keep the tree clean it has been agreed that Holbek's version is mirrored in geni at this point.
2 CONT
2 CONT Roskildehistorie.dk says that Niels Jensen Rosenkrantz was married to either Anne Ottesdatter Skinkel or Anne Ottesdatter Bild - it might even be infered that he was married to both
2 CONT
2 CONT ANY HELP YOU MAY BE ABLE TO PROVIDE IN DOCUMENTING THE RELATIONSHIPS WOULD BE APPRECIATED
2 CONT
2 CONT Torbjorn Nilsen
2 CONT
