1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Dorthe Gundesdatter (Lange) Rosenkrantz''' was born in 1541 in Tryggevælde hovedgård, Køgevej 67, Karise, Fakse, Præstø, Danmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31822868 Gunde Hansen Lange] and [https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/profile-31822921 Karen Hansdatter Breide]. She was a Dronningens hofjomfru.. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorthe married [https://www.geni.com/profile-9066866 Jørgen Ottesen Rosenkrantz] on February 5, 1559 in H°neborg. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1560 [https://www.geni.com/profile-31841024 Otte Jørgensen Rosenkrantz];
2 CONT * 1561 [https://www.geni.com/profile-31823096 Margrethe Jørgensdatter Rosenkrantz];
2 CONT * 1574 [https://www.geni.com/profile-9066832 Holger Jørgensen Rosenkrantz, af Rosenholm]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 9, 1613 in Skaføgård, Mørke by, Hvilsager, Sønderhald, Randers, Denmark and was buried on March 23, 1613 in Hornslet Kirke. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Hun kom 7 år gammel i Dronning Dorotheas Jomfrukammer og blev i sit 12 år Dron ningens egen kammerjomfru. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorte Lange (1541-1613) is listed in the Lange Pedigree chart here: denstoredanske.dk/Dansk_Biografisk_Leksikon/Samfund,_jura_og_politik/Slægter/Lange
