2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396746?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000116663992908 '''Letters to Adolf Johan from Rosenschantz, Gynter Göransson''']
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396746&photo_id=6000000116664672897&position=0 '''Letter concept from Per Abrahamsson Brahe. To officials. Military to Rosenschantz, Gynter Göransson''']
