1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Christence Juel=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Christence Juel (born 26 August 1612 , died 11 November 1680 ) was a Danish noblewoman. She was the daughter of Jens Juel (b. 1580) to Kjeldgård and Ide Hansdatter Lange . She was married on 12 August 1637 to Jørgen Rosenkrantz 
2 CONC . In this marriage she gave birth to 10 children. Information about her is otherwise sparse.
