1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Magdalene Henriksdatter Rantzau''' was born on November 22, 1559 in Breitenburg, Steinburg, Slesvig-Holsten, Tyskland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-13761862 Heinrich Rantzau, Graf] and [https://www.geni.com/pr
2 CONC ofile-75793804 Christina von Rantzau (von Halle), Drakenburg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Magdalene married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825484 Claus von Ahlefeldt, Gjelting] in 1573 in Breitenburg, Steinburg, Slesvig-Holsten, Tyskland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31834816 Carl von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825440 Claus von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-122380387 Didrik von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34651953787 Margarethe Clausdatter von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-42421266 Christine Clausdatter von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31828279 Johan von Ahlefeldt]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on November 21, 1635 in Kiel, Slesvig-Holsten, Tyskland. 
2 CONT ----
