1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT You will find Niels Trolle listed on page 26: "Det Nationalhistoriske musaeum paa Frederiksborg slot" https://archive.org/details/detnationalhisto00hill/page/26
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I2968&tree=2
