1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Johanne Simensdatter (c. 1639 – July 1716)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT A member of the '''Coldevin''' family of Tønsberg, who became the matriarch of the prominent '''Mørch''' family in the Sandefjord and Larvik regions through her marriage to [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Aleksandersson-Allexsen
2 CONC -Mørch/6000000015470464796?through=6000000002278479966 Knud Alexanderssøn Mørch].
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Parentage''': Daughter of '''Simen N. N'''. and [https://www.geni.com/people/Alhed-Coldevey/6000000022163540838?through=6000000015472124015 '''Alhed Cortsdatter (Coldevin)''']. Her maternal grandfather was '''Cort Coldevey'''
2 CONC , and her great-grandfather was the [https://www.geni.com/people/Jørgen-Stenshede/6000000003421924369 '''Lawman Jørgen Lauritsen'''].
2 CONT * '''Birth and Death''': Born around '''1639'''. She was buried on '''July 29, 1716''', in Sandefjord, at the age of '''77'''.
2 CONT * '''Marriage and Issue''': Married to [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Aleksandersson-Allexsen-Mørch/6000000015470464796?through=6000000015472124015 '''Knut Alexandersen Mørch'''] (d. 1673), a prosperous businessman and the foun
2 CONC ding father of the '''Mørch''' family in the region. '''Their children included''':
2 CONT # '''Alexander Knudsen Mørch''' (b. 1665): Continued the family line.
2 CONT # '''Jørgen Knudsen Mørch''' (b. 1667): Travelled to the East Indies in 1685 and never returned.
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Anders-Mørch/6000000002278479966?through=6000000015470464796 '''Anders Knudsen Mørch'''] (b. 1673): Served as a shipmaster (skipper).
2 CONT # '''Daughters''': Aleth, Sibylle, Catharine Marie, and Johanne.
2 CONT * '''Social Standing''': After her husband's early death in 1673, Johanne maintained her status within the merchant elite of Sandefjord, as evidenced by her children's successful careers in shipping and trade.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # '''Mørch, G.''': "Familien Mørch fra Sandefjord og Larvik", PHT (1926), [https://www.genealogi.dk/images/pht/1926/1926_8-5-3.pdf pp. 232-234].
2 CONT # '''Torkel Fagerli''': "Trelasthandler Christen Simensen i Sandefjord - og litt om Coldevin, Giedde, Mørch, Lem", Gjallarhorn nr. 38, juni 2006, side 375-380.
2 CONT # '''Sandefjord Church Records''': Burial register (1716).
2 CONT # '''Sveinaage.com''': [https://www.sveinaage.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Notteroy-garder-sok.pdf Nøtterøy Gårds- og slektshistorie].
2 CONT ——————
2 CONT
2 CONT * Link: https://slekt1.com/familien-morch-fra-melsomvik-og-smaalenene-1923/
2 CONT
2 CONT * Link: https://www.sveinaage.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Notteroy-garder-sok.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Alhed Cortsdatter, født ca. 1611. Begravet 10. juli 1690 fra Vår Frues kirke i Tønsberg, 79 5/12 år
2 CONT gammel. Innført i kirkeboken for St. Laurenti sogn i Tønsberg. Gift med Simen N. N.
2 CONT Barn:
2 CONT 1. Christen Simensen, nevnt 1660-åra-død ca. 1685 i Tønsberg. Trelasthandler i Sandefjord. Gift og
2 CONT minst 7 barn.
2 CONT 2. '''Johanne Simensdatter''', født ca. 1639. Begravet 29. juli 1716 i Sandefjord, 77 år gammel. '''Gift
2 CONT med Knut Alexandersen Mørch'''.
2 CONT 3. Peder Simensen, skifte 4. oktober 1690. Skipper i Sandefjord. Gift med Margrethe Michelsdatter
2 CONT (Due), enke 1690.
2 CONT 4. Aarse Simensdatter, skifte 14. februar 1693 i Sandefjord. Gift med Lauritz Andersen Haug i
2 CONT Sandefjord. Faren fra Øvre Haug på Tjøme.
