2 CONT * '''Jakob Jakobsson (Snakenborg).''' Vice President. Death 1627. 
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Jakobsdotter.''' Married in 1627 with the outright man Olof Svensson, who was Jakob Jakobsson Snakenborg's farmer. In 1603 she had been guilty of cruelty and was therefore excluded from all legacy.
