1 CONC 11 at Torrlösachurch, daughter of the Danish councillor of the realm Breide Rantzau and Sodia Rosenkrantz); married 2ndly 15 October 1615 at Malmö Kerstin Urup (born 5 June 1594 at Ovesholm, died 5 March 1620 at Sölvesborg castle,
